    },
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100,
              "y": 0
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2Fp3WpQZzLg6350gWPUEM2.png?alt=media&token=09807aae-0b9c-4360-8d22-93bb12c2fbb5"
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "value": {
          "description": "**Description**\nA chronic mystical illness caused by exposure to excessive, uncontrolled, or otherwise dangerous magical energies, Arcane Contamination Syndrome is an annoying but non-fatal magical disease as classified by the Helical Archive. Usually referred to as “Odditis” by laymen, a few historical texts note that this strange malady has been vexing folk potentially as far back as the 2nd Aeon.\n\n**Contraction**\nArcane Contamination Syndrome is usually contracted when consuming items that have been tainted by magical pollution or exposure to bursts of unrefined mana. Certain creatures and Abilities may also infect individuals.\n\nWhenever you are exposed to Arcane Contamination due to staying in a place with excessive magical pollution, consuming tainted food or drink, or are the target of an ability or other source noted to cause Odditis, make a Grit Check.\n\nOn a success, you are free of Arcane Contamination Syndrome and are immune to contracting it for 24 hours. On a failure, you are afflicted with Arcane Contamination Syndrome\n\n**Stages of Infection**\nThere is only one stage of infection of Arcane Contamination Syndrome. It is a persistent and annoying malady, rather than one that progresses in a potentially lethal way. \n\nOnce you have contracted Odditis, roll on the symptom table and apply the result immediately. This effect ends after 24 hours, after which you should roll again for a new symptom, and repeat.\n\n**Treatment and Cure**\n- Not ingesting any contaminated or imbued consumables and avoiding being the direct target of any magical abilities for at least a week will cure you of Arcane Contamination Syndrome.\n- Having the effects dispelled by the Sage’s Demystify or a similar Ability will also free you of this magical disease."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "table": {
            "rows": [
              {
                "range": {
                  "end": 2,
                  "start": 1
                },
                "description": "Anytime you try to speak, nothing but bubbles come out. This prevents you from verbal communication or using any Abilities that require speech. Sounds emerge if the bubbles burst, but anything longer than a short phrase is so jumbled it’s unintelligible.",
                "showDescription": false,
                "result": "Word Bubbles"
              },
              {
                "description": "Your head is spinning and nothing makes sense! You are afflicted with the Disoriented Ailment for the duration of this symptom",
                "showDescription": false,
                "result": "Dizzy Distress",
                "range": {
                  "end": 4,
                  "start": 3
                }
              },
              {
                "range": {
                  "end": 6,
                  "start": 5
                },
                "showDescription": false,
                "result": "Grossly Incandescent ",
                "description": "Your body glows brightly, making it hard to look at you directly. You do provide illumination like a torch, but you stick out like a sore thumb in the shadows and darkness, making stealth almost impossible unless you cover yourself up  completely."
              },
              {
                "result": "Stony Feet",
                "description": "Your lower half turns to stone! You remain on the first stage of the Petrification Ailment for the duration of this symptom.",
                "showDescription": false,
                "range": {
                  "end": 8,
                  "start": 7
                }
              },
              {
                "description": "You won’t be reaching the top shelf for a bit. You are afflicted with the Chibbed Ailment for the duration of this symptom.",
                "showDescription": false,
                "result": "Hex Shrunk",
                "range": {
                  "start": 9,
                  "end": 10
                }
              },
              {
                "range": {
                  "start": 11,
                  "end": 12
                },
                "showDescription": false,
                "description": "Your hands grow to twice their size, less than optimal for delicate tasks. You have a Snag on all Deftness Checks and Contests requiring fine motor skills involving your massive mitts, and cannot properly use small tools and weapons (such as Concealed Melee and Small Mechanical Missile Weapons).",
                "result": "Hammed Hands"
              },
              {
                "showDescription": false,
                "description": "You’re suddenly much taller. This growth isn’t proportional though, and you’ve grown gangly and awkward. For the duration of this symptom you have a Snag on all Deftness Checks and are probably hitting your head on the top of doorways a lot.",
                "result": "Stretch Sickness",
                "range": {
                  "start": 13,
                  "end": 14
                }
              },
              {
                "range": {
                  "start": 15,
                  "end": 16
                },
                "description": "You just don’t feel quite right. Your positive traits invert into negative versions of themselves, subtracting from your aptitudes instead of adding to them for the duration of this symptom.",
                "result": "The Jumbles",
                "showDescription": false
              },
              {
                "range": {
                  "end": 18,
                  "start": 17
                },
                "description": "You’re covered in odd colored spots! Unfortunately these act as mana magnets of sorts - for the duration of this symptom you have a Snag when trying to roll to resist or avoid a magical effect or Ability.",
                "result": "Spell Spots",
                "showDescription": false
              },
              {
                "showDescription": true,
                "result": "The Wobblies",
                "description": "You’ve become downright gelatinous. For the duration of this symptom you’re afflicted with the Jellified Ailment.",
                "range": {
                  "end": 20,
                  "start": 19
                }
              }
            ],
            "baseRoll": "1d20",
            "name": "Syndrome"
          }
        },
        "type": "table"
      }
    ],
    "version": 2,
