                "showDescription": true,
                "description": "- Your next Action is lost while you regain your composure."
              },
              {
                "result": "Superficial burn",
                "description": "- You suffer a -1 Penalty to all rolls until the Injury receives Treatment.\n- If you are already suffering from this Injury, and receive it a second time, treat it as a Serious Burn.",
